---
import wordmark from "../assets/Aevyndal-Wordmark-v1-WhiteBlood.png";

const ages = [
  { n: 1, slug: "1st-age", name: "Creation", line: "Sythlia makes the world. Death doesn't exist yet.", accent: "#b49a6a" },
  { n: 2, slug: "2nd-age", name: "God-Kings", line: "Living gods rule. Mortals kneel or rebel.", accent: "#a9643d" },
  { n: 3, slug: "3rd-age", name: "Expansion", line: "The god-kings are driven out. Mortals claim the map.", accent: "#6f8791" },
  { n: 4, slug: "4th-age", name: "The Harrow", line: "Empires at their height, ruins beneath them.", accent: "#8d7446" },
  { n: 5, slug: "5th-age", name: "Collapse", line: "Nature takes the world back.", accent: "#818d58" },
  { n: 6, slug: "6th-age", name: "Reason", line: "Faith falls. Science and the occult rise.", accent: "#9a8668" },
  { n: 7, slug: "7th-age", name: "Syndicate", line: "Starships, and one corporation ruling three galaxies.", accent: "#7194a5" },
  { n: 8, slug: "8th-age", name: "Hope", line: "Rebuilding is the work.", accent: "#9ea86f" },
];
const pad = (n: number) => String(n).padStart(2, "0");
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover" />
<title>Ævyndal | One world. Eight ages.</title>
<meta name="description" content="A dark fantasy world on one unbroken timeline, from bronze-age god-kings to a star-spanning empire. Every Age inherits the wounds of the last." />
<meta property="og:title" content="Ævyndal | One world. Eight ages. Zero barriers." />
<meta property="og:description" content="A dark fantasy world on one unbroken timeline, from bronze-age god-kings to a star-spanning empire." />
<style is:global>
  :root{
    --bg:#07090d; --bg2:#10161d; --ink:#d8d9d6; --muted:#8a9298;
    --line:rgba(216,217,214,.16); --line-soft:rgba(216,217,214,.07);
    --accent:#8d7446; --accent-rgb:141,116,70;
    --headline: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    --ui: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    --micro: 'Courier New', ui-monospace, monospace;
    --ease:cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.22,1);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;background:#07090d}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--ui);line-height:1.6;
    background:
      radial-gradient(90vw 70vh at 78% 0%, rgba(52,77,86,.22), transparent 63%),
      radial-gradient(65vw 75vh at 20% 60%, rgba(var(--accent-rgb),.07), transparent 72%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),var(--bg2) 50%,var(--bg));
    background-attachment:fixed;background-color:var(--bg);min-height:100vh}
  body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;opacity:.3;pointer-events:none;
    background-image:linear-gradient(var(--line-soft) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line-soft) 1px,transparent 1px);
    background-size:64px 64px;
    mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.4),#000 20%,#000 80%,rgba(0,0,0,.2));}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  .micro{font-family:var(--micro);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase}

  .topbar{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:72px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 4vw;z-index:20;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,9,13,.92),rgba(7,9,13,0))}
  .mark-logo{display:block;width:200px;height:auto}
  .nav{display:flex;gap:2.4vw}
  .nav a{position:relative;padding:10px 0;opacity:.82}
  .nav a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:100%;bottom:4px;height:1px;background:var(--accent);transition:right .45s var(--ease)}
  .nav a:hover::after,.nav a:focus-visible::after{right:0}

  section{position:relative;padding:0 4vw}

  /* Hero */
  .hero{min-height:100svh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding-top:96px;padding-bottom:10vh}
  .hero .kicker{color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 2rem 0.3rem}
  .hero h1{margin:0;font-family:var(--headline);font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:.86;font-size:clamp(56px,9vw,168px);color:rgba(223,225,223,.92)}
  .hero h1 span{display:block}
  .hero h1 span:nth-child(2){margin-left:6vw}
  .hero h1 span:nth-child(3){margin-left:12vw;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px rgba(225,225,220,.7)}
  .hero .pitch{max-width:34rem;margin:3rem 0 0 12vw;font-family:var(--headline);font-size:clamp(19px,1.6vw,25px);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(232,232,228,.85)}
  .ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.6rem;align-items:center;margin:2.4rem 0 0 12vw}
  .btn{display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;border:1px solid rgba(var(--accent-rgb),.7);color:var(--ink);transition:background .35s var(--ease),border-color .35s var(--ease)}
  .btn:hover,.btn:focus-visible{background:rgba(var(--accent-rgb),.18);border-color:var(--accent)}
  .link{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:4px;transition:border-color .35s var(--ease)}
  .link:hover,.link:focus-visible{border-color:var(--accent)}

  /* Different */
  .different{padding-top:14vh;padding-bottom:14vh;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
  .label{color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 3rem}
  .claims{display:grid;gap:4rem;max-width:1200px}
  .claim{max-width:30rem}
  .claim h2{margin:0 0 .8rem;font-family:var(--headline);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,54px);line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .claim p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(16px,1.15vw,18px)}
  @media (min-width:900px){
    .claim:nth-child(1){margin-left:0}
    .claim:nth-child(2){margin-left:34vw}
    .claim:nth-child(3){margin-left:14vw}
  }

  /* Ages */
  .ages{padding-top:12vh;padding-bottom:14vh;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
  .ages-head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;max-width:1200px}
  .ages-head h2{margin:0;font-family:var(--headline);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,64px);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1}
  .ages-head p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:26rem}
  .age-list{list-style:none;margin:4rem 0 0;padding:0;max-width:1200px}
  .age-list li{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .age-list li:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .age-list a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4.5rem minmax(9rem,16rem) 1fr auto;gap:1.5rem;align-items:baseline;padding:1.5rem 0;transition:padding .4s var(--ease),color .4s var(--ease)}
  .age-list .num{color:var(--a)}
  .age-list .name{font-family:var(--headline);font-size:clamp(22px,2vw,32px);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.1}
  .age-list .line{color:var(--muted)}
  .age-list .arrow{opacity:0;color:var(--a);transform:translateX(-6px);transition:.35s var(--ease)}
  .age-list a:hover,.age-list a:focus-visible{padding-left:1rem;color:var(--a)}
  .age-list a:hover .line,.age-list a:focus-visible .line{color:var(--ink)}
  .age-list a:hover .arrow,.age-list a:focus-visible .arrow{opacity:1;transform:none}
  .age-list li.here .name::after{content:"Start here";display:block;margin-top:.35rem;font-family:var(--micro);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--a);vertical-align:middle}

  /* Start */
  .start{padding-top:14vh;padding-bottom:16vh;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
  .start-grid{display:grid;gap:4rem;max-width:1200px}
  .start h2{margin:0;font-family:var(--headline);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(40px,5.5vw,92px);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:.9}
  .start h2 span{display:block;margin-left:5vw;color:var(--accent)}
  .start .body{max-width:32rem}
  .start .body p{margin:0 0 1.6rem;font-family:var(--headline);font-size:clamp(18px,1.45vw,23px);line-height:1.5;color:rgba(232,232,228,.86)}
  .door{margin:2.6rem 0 2.6rem;padding-left:1.2rem;border-left:1px solid var(--accent)}
  .door b{display:block;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:400}
  .door span{font-family:var(--headline);font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(18px,1.4vw,22px)}
  @media (min-width:900px){.start-grid{grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;align-items:end}}

  footer{padding:3rem 4vw 4rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;color:var(--muted)}
  footer a:hover{color:var(--ink)}

  @media (max-width:760px){
    .topbar{height:60px;padding:0 20px}.mark-logo{width:150px}.nav{gap:16px}.nav a:nth-child(n+2){display:none}.nav{letter-spacing:.16em}
    section{padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}
    .hero h1 span:nth-child(2),.hero h1 span:nth-child(3){margin-left:0}
    .hero .pitch,.ctas{margin-left:0}
    .age-list a{grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:.3rem 1rem}
    .age-list .line{grid-column:2}.age-list .arrow{display:none}
    .start h2 span{margin-left:0}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{transition-duration:.01ms!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <a href="/" aria-label="Ævyndal home"><img class="mark-logo" src={wordmark.src} alt="ÆVYNDAL" /></a>
  <nav class="nav micro" aria-label="Primary">
    <a href="#ages">The Ages</a>
    <a href="#start">Start here</a>
    <a href="https://grimwell.studio">Grimwell Studio</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <p class="kicker micro">A dark fantasy world</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title"><span>One world.</span><span>Eight ages.</span><span>Zero barriers.</span></h1>
    <p class="pitch">A dark fantasy world on one unbroken timeline, from bronze-age god-kings to a star-spanning empire. Every Age inherits the wounds of the last.</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="btn micro" href="/ages/4th-age">Enter the 4th Age</a>
      <a class="link micro" href="#ages">See all eight Ages</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="different" aria-label="What makes Ævyndal different">
    <p class="label micro">What makes it different</p>
    <div class="claims">
      <div class="claim">
        <h2>Magic is fallout.</h2>
        <p>It's what was left behind when a god died violently. It's rare, it costs, and it changes you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="claim">
        <h2>Nothing stays buried.</h2>
        <p>It's the same world from swords to starships, and what one Age breaks, the next one inherits.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="claim">
        <h2>No elves. No dwarves.</h2>
        <p>Your lineage shapes your body. Where you grew up shapes who you are.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ages" id="ages" aria-labelledby="ages-title">
    <div class="ages-head">
      <h2 id="ages-title">The eight Ages</h2>
      <p>Each Age is a different kind of story, carrying the consequences of the ones before it.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="age-list">
      {ages.map((a) => (
        <li class={a.n === 4 ? "here" : undefined} style={`--a:${a.accent}`}>
          <a href={`/ages/${a.slug}`}>
            <span class="num micro">{pad(a.n)}</span>
            <span class="name">{a.name}</span>
            <span class="line">{a.line}</span>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="start" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-title">
    <div class="start-grid">
      <h2 id="start-title">Start in the<span>4th Age.</span></h2>
      <div class="body">
        <p>Empires have never been richer. Beneath them sit the ruins of the god-kings, and people go down into them. That descent has a name: the Harrow.</p>
        <div class="door">
          <b class="micro">Mütvia</b>
          <span>The land remembers what you bury.</span>
        </div>
        <a class="btn micro" href="/ages/4th-age">Enter the 4th Age</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="micro">
  <span>Ævyndal · A Grimwell Studio world</span>
  <span><a href="/unspoken">The Unspoken</a> · <a href="https://grimwell.studio">grimwell.studio</a></span>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
